{"title": "Hayden Panettiere and Wladimir Klitschko's relationship and her death", "summary": "Actress Hayden Panettiere, known for her role in \"Heroes,\" died on Sunday. Her former partner, former heavyweight boxing champion Wladimir Klitschko, with whom she shared a child, stated he is in \"profound shock and grief.\" Klitschko reflected on their nine-year relationship, noting that their shared times and Panettiere's place in their lives would not be erased. The news outlets focused on the relationship between Panettiere and Klitschko and his reaction to her death.", "summary_points": ["Actress Hayden Panettiere died on Sunday.", "She shared a child with former heavyweight boxing champion Wladimir Klitschko.", "Klitschko stated he is in \"profound shock and grief\" following her death.", "He reflected on their nine-year relationship, emphasizing the lasting impact of their shared times.", "Coverage focused on the relationship and Klitschko's reaction to Panettiere's passing."], "title_hi": "हेडन पैनेटीयर और व्लादिमीर क्लिट्स्को का रिश्ता और उनकी मृत्यु", "summary_hi": "एक्ट्रेस हेडन पैनेटीयर, जिन्हें \"हीरोज\" में उनकी भूमिका के लिए जाना जाता है, का रविवार को निधन हो गया। उनके पूर्व साथी, पूर्व हैवीवेट मुक्केबाजी चैंपियन व्लादिमीर क्लिट्स्को, जिनके साथ उनका एक बच्चा था, ने कहा कि वे \"गहरे सदमे और दुख\" में हैं। क्लिट्स्को ने अपने नौ साल के रिश्ते पर विचार किया, यह देखते हुए कि उनके साझा समय और पैनेटीयर के उनके जीवन में स्थान को मिटाया नहीं जाएगा। समाचार आउटलेट्स ने पैनेटीयर और क्लिट्स्को के बीच के रिश्ते और उनकी मृत्यु पर उनकी प्रतिक्रिया पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया।", "summary_points_hi": ["एक्ट्रेस हेडन पैनेटीयर का रविवार को निधन हो गया।", "उनका एक बच्चा पूर्व हैवीवेट मुक्केबाजी चैंपियन व्लादिमीर क्लिट्स्को के साथ था।", "क्लिट्स्को ने उनकी मृत्यु के बाद \"गहरे सदमे और दुख\" में होने की बात कही।", "उन्होंने अपने नौ साल के रिश्ते पर विचार किया, साझा समय के स्थायी प्रभाव पर जोर दिया।", "कवरेज में रिश्ते और पैनेटीयर के निधन पर क्लिट्स्को की प्रतिक्रिया पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया।"], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Society", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/a08e/live/b953e5a0-9ad9-11f1-b2f7-5d1639b20e22.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Evening Standard", "owner": "Evening Standard", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNbURseGJGSTRiNTk0NGUwdU80X09GZ3ZEYlZPNEFfVG1UTm1BS0hoNWJqMXB0bC1ZY3M4VGFjWlZLMnNqSEZLLXlKWEFVQ2RmbUJGaGVrODJSR1paRHNydUFlQXB0OV84M3llLWM1R3R3aGItWjhNOTVINlhYR1hTVXlFaml4aXpZaFR5cklid1phMUs3SVFGNE5vZWRUUnlMV3c?oc=5", "headline": "Inside Hayden Panattiere and Wladimir Klitschko's nine-year-long relationship"}, {"source": "BBC News", "owner": "BBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5ywe951z80o", "headline": "Hayden Panettiere's ex Wladimir Klitschko says family in 'profound shock and grief'"}, {"source": "The New York Times", "owner": "The New York Times", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPX3lDSlZGcms3a3V4MTZPRWJVamxFYWdvRGN1dEF0dUc1STZoSXRIV1VCM2U1czhMQjFvQ3hDWGJELS1hcE15U1VWa213RWlMOEdVZkF0dEJRZFhvOWw2Y0tuaU5YMGNYUmFqdDhzSnU5Zml0dXNIYUs4MTg0Z19rSzZDZThrTF90bWFRYmd3NG1MZTRz?oc=5", "headline": "Hayden Panettiere: A Life in Pictures"}, {"source": "Euronews", "owner": "Euronews", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "http://www.euronews.com/culture/2026/08/18/wladimir-klitschko-says-he-is-in-profound-shock-following-death-of-ex-partner-hayden-panet", "headline": "Wladimir Klitschko says he is in 'profound shock' following death of ex-partner Hayden Panettiere"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/beauty/after-hayden-panettieres-death-her-shocking-claim-about-losing-a-beauty-deal-over-ppd-resurfaces/articleshow/133316373.cms", "headline": "After Hayden Pa